## Why This Is Asked
Assess the candidate’s ability to structure a practical CBA for a distributed architecture shift, weighing latency, privacy, and cost against risk reduction and retention gains.

## Key Concepts
- Edge computing vs centralized analytics
- Inference costs, device storage, data transfer
- Regulatory/compliance penalties and risk
- Uplift in fraud detection and user retention
- Break-even analysis and sensitivity testing

## Code Example
```javascript
function breakEven(initialCost, monthlySavings, monthlyCosts) {
  let months = 0;
  let net = -initialCost;
  while (net < 0) {
    net += (monthlySavings - monthlyCosts);
    months++;
  }
  return months;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you design the data governance model to satisfy privacy regulations across regions?
- What mitigation plans exist if edge devices underperform (false positives, latency spikes, battery impact)?

## Why This Is Asked
This question explores a privacy-preserving on-device machine learning use case with real-world constraints including energy efficiency, latency requirements, data minimization principles, and regulatory compliance. It emphasizes the importance of measurable go/no-go criteria and a concrete break-even timeline for implementation decisions.

## Key Concepts
- On-device machine learning models (autoencoder/isolation forest)
- Energy and performance budgeting for background tasks
- Data minimization and privacy impact assessments
- Go/No-Go criteria and break-even horizon analysis

## Code Example
```javascript
function detectAnomaly(readings, threshold){
  const mean = readings.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)/readings.length;
  const variance = readings.reduce((a,b)=>a+Math.pow(b-mean,2),0)/readings.length;
  return Math.abs(readings[readings.length-1] - mean) > threshold * Math.sqrt(variance);
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
Assesses ability to quantify edge privacy investments, regulatory costs, and business impact for a real-world data minimization feature across Cloudflare/Snowflake contexts.

## Key Concepts
